9d/uploads/origins/d54ed48f-cfcd-489f-a060-677b3b70d1f4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a920c0afadd26e8075d21b959bf797b5, https://si.imgix.net/3923fc9d/uploads/origins/d54ed48f-cfcd-489f-a060-677b3b70d1f4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=aa3f9a5ea169dec8411f4c0563f56cf1 2x, https://si.imgix.net/3923fc9d/uploads/origins/d54ed48f-cfcd-489f-a060-677b3b70d1f4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0b91a8b63fdb2944d27124e2bd0c5b47 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "こんばんわ！素晴らしいイラスト拝見しましてぜひ私のうちの子NSFWイラスト依頼をお願いします！\n\nアメリアは母性溢れる甘え上手な魔術師お姉さんです。巨乳でお尻も大きいえっちなスタイル。\n\n構造\n恋人視点からの騎乗位セックスしてるシーン\nアメリアはパンツを脱いでて胸はずらして露出してる感じでお願いします。\n\nその他細かい所はおまかせします。\n\nよろしくお願いします！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1Qo8xF13E0ldlZOtBeUBoYfaddcckPbJH?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@kurutarou/works/20", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/9657d767/uploads/origins/e1c18dce-6b59-45eb-985d-dcc9916a9fad?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=dd036658ed08bbf9b3dbebd9c38a8ef5", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/9657d767/uploads/origins/e1c18dce-6b59-45eb-985d-dcc9916a9fad?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=dd036658ed08bbf9b3dbebd9c38a8ef5, https://si.imgix.net/9657d767/uploads/origins/e1c18dce-6b59-45eb-985d-dcc9916a9fad?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=27cb2edd246b1a3f7640ef55266dd115 2x, https://si.imgix.net/9657d767/uploads/origins/e1c18dce-6b59-45eb-985d-dcc9916a9fad?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d3e7eede2faa026450679ac475211478 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "こんにちは！また私のキャラクターのイラストをお願いします。彼女は大人っぽい外見と性格をしています。夜と宇宙がテーマです。参考写真のようなポーズを希望します。露出の多い寝間着を着て、ベッドに寝そべって、遊び心のある表情で。kurutarouさん、リクエストに応えていただきありがとうございました！\n\nキャラクター：https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1t0jtRnI8y3Kaci00chdOojV7QD-Nn1vo?usp=drive_link\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1cIv0U7bjHh3mcRpEXnZ9aCvtU4nMCsFH/view?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@kurutarou/works/19", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/a828e8ae/uploads/origins/6c7236ce-d967-422e-87be-daabed433597?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e282c8801461ee090e7d57b6a02a2fe4", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a828e8ae/uploads/origins/6c7236ce-d967-422e-87be-daabed433597?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e282c8801461ee090e7d57b6a02a2fe4, https://si.imgix.net/a828e8ae/uploads/origins/6c7236ce-d967-422e-87be-daabed433597?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3e112eba67844bc5ddccfbf598773908 2x, https://si.imgix.net/a828e8ae/uploads/origins/6c7236ce-d967-422e-87be-daabed433597?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=56e839a828b866d69d673990e063e590 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは、くる太郎さん。いつも素敵なイラストをありがとうございます！また、私のキャラクター＜アリエル＞の新衣装のイラストをお願いしてもよろしいでしょうか？\n\nアリエル：https://www.deviantart.com/stash/27jlyf5m406\n\n甘い顔立ちで清楚な印象のアリエルですが、本性は計算高いです。彼女の物語の舞台はマフィア。ふくよかな体型で描いていただけると嬉しいです。ポーズや構図はお任せします。\n\n可能であれば、看板レイヤーをイラストとは別にしたPSDファイルで納品をお願いします。いつもご配慮ありがとうございます。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@kurutarou/works/18", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/d6c292f9/uploads/origins/02649df1-b751-4efb-9d3f-3c40ad8a9f76?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f1eca870ec55c744d865613f24168618", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d6c292f9/uploads/origins/02649df1-b751-4efb-9d3f-3c40ad8a9f76?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f1eca870ec55c744d865613f24168618, https://si.imgix.net/d6c292f9/uploads/origins/02649df1-b751-4efb-9d3f-3c40ad8a9f76?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8dcda8f647c3f67d69953c8f0984d1f9 2x, https://si.imgix.net/d6c292f9/uploads/origins/02649df1-b751-4efb-9d3f-3c40ad8a9f76?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9755404360e0ca9974c02706c1907a9c 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "Hello again! Here to request another sexy illustration! Though it's NSFW this time.\n\nsta.sh/0h6zw7qleh5\n\nI'd like the same character! Specifically a NSFW continuation of the previous scene in the classroom. I don't have a pose or composition in mind. She can be bent over the desk, or on her back, or on her side. Whatever you think looks best! She is the type to be bratty and teasing throughout, even if the guy is in control, so I'd like a face and mannerisms mirroring that.\n\nThank you and have a good day!", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@kurutarou/works/17", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/4855016b/uploads/origins/76a4b099-2dfa-41aa-a319-63bb805a7b9c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9ae554f10b632191d2d1bb1325a52f4f", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/4855016b/uploads/origins/76a4b099-2dfa-41aa-a319-63bb805a7b9c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9ae554f10b632191d2d1bb1325a52f4f, https://si.imgix.net/4855016b/uploads/origins/76a4b099-2dfa-41aa-a319-63bb805a7b9c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1dab5aec1a88541313bec1fea5743700 2x, https://si.imgix.net/4855016b/uploads/origins/76a4b099-2dfa-41aa-a319-63bb805a7b9c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=58049606ba1fbbde1be5e286fe8a9582 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello again! Thank you once more for your illustrations, they are lovely as always! I'm here to request another sexy illustration, if that's okay!\n\nsta.sh/0h6zw7qleh5\n\nValentina is a succubus born into a mafia family. She hates men, and lures lustful sinners to their deaths to harvest their souls and chew as bubblegum. A vigilante for fun, she finds misfortune funny and is big on appearances and putting on a show.\n\nI will leave the scene and composition to you, but I think looking sexy in a classroom would look nice! Thank you for your consideration!", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@kurutarou/works/16", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/2dafad8a/uploads/origins/96d89a6e-8058-4e6a-b53a-1b80f9d7a71f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=69d9632c9572f5f08e2b6e1c2d94350d", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/2dafad8a/uploads/origins/96d89a6e-8058-4e6a-b53a-1b80f9d7a71f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=69d9632c9572f5f08e2b6e1c2d94350d, https://si.imgix.net/2dafad8a/uploads/origins/96d89a6e-8058-4e6a-b53a-1b80f9d7a71f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cb64ee30457b7fe1c114cc96c7f43003 2x, https://si.imgix.net/2dafad8a/uploads/origins/96d89a6e-8058-4e6a-b53a-1b80f9d7a71f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=73279627164fa13e2fadcf1468416e7e 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは、ポテチコラーラさん。私のキャラクター＜オードリー＞のセクシーなイラストをお願いしたいです。\n\nhttps://toyhou.se/32794094.oc-refs/33354841.audrey-fulbright/gallery?key=VrVfygVU5olEHYs\n\nいろいろな衣装がありますので、お好きなものを選んでください。\n\nオードリーは正義感の強いアメリカのチアリーダーです。またセクシーなイラストを描いていただけると嬉しいです。ポーズや構図はお任せします。ご検討よろしくお願いします。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@kurutarou/works/15", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/d8727df2/uploads/origins/8b5fe7da-522a-46b1-8650-6661870f5b5b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=63550ead18bd2fe14fd524175c8af534", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d8727df2/uploads/origins/8b5fe7da-522a-46b1-8650-6661870f5b5b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=63550ead18bd2fe14fd524175c8af534, https